{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Punch zombies. Fill your shopping list. Race to checkout before your rivals\u2014or the clock\u2014takes you out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Checkout Blitz: The Shopping Dead</i> is an arcade-style roguelite where you\u2019re a courier shopper ripping through zombie-infested aisles. Each chaotic run drops you into a new store layout packed with hazards, power-ups, and absurd shopping lists.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play solo, partner up in co-op, or clash in versus mode. Level up your shopper class, unlock new upgrades, and turn mundane retail into mayhem.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Easy to pick up. Chaotic to master. Just don\u2019t forget: <strong>dead shoppers don\u2019t get refunds.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2621760/extras/82f42fa4a466ba1109320fe11f46ee60.poster.avif?t=1755646226\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2621760/extras/82f42fa4a466ba1109320fe11f46ee60.webm?t=1755646226\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2621760/extras/82f42fa4a466ba1109320fe11f46ee60.mp4?t=1755646226\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Arcade Roguelike Mayhem</strong> \u2013 Every run is different: random stores, item lists, hazards, and enemy spawns keep you on your toes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Punch-First Shopping</strong> \u2013 Fend off zombies, dodge traps, and knock out rival players to finish your list first.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>3 Game Modes</strong> \u2013 Play solo, share a list in co-op, or race to win in versus mode. (Controller/Gamepad required for local multiplayer)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shopper Class Progression</strong> \u2013 Level up through 5 shopper ranks with permanent upgrades.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Earn. Upgrade. Repeat.</strong> \u2013 Your shopper rank persists across runs, unlocking higher stats and bigger payouts.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Power-Ups &amp; Pickups</strong> \u2013 Unlock boosts like speed carts, cash multipliers, and weird gimmicks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Full Gamepad Support</strong> \u2013 Optimized for couch play with local co-op and versus modes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Achievements &amp; Replay Value</strong> \u2013 Unlock ridiculous milestones and chase high scores with randomized runs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Retro Flair</strong> \u2013 Vibrant vector-pixel visuals, snappy soundtrack, and arcade-style presentation.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Aisle Explorer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2621760/117406c0e07c32fd1adef2b16819477aa42755a1.jpg"},{"name":"Bag It Up","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2621760/117406c0e07c32fd1adef2b16819477aa42755a1.jpg"},{"name":"Bulk Brawler","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2621760/35ff321b7b9974b3de1dc57ba0b2f8b63122cd66.jpg"},{"name":"Bulk Buyer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2621760/117406c0e07c32fd1adef2b16819477aa42755a1.jpg"},{"name":"Cart Commander","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2621760/35ff321b7b9974b3de1dc57ba0b2f8b63122cd66.jpg"},{"name":"Checkout Champion","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2621760/35ff321b7b9974b3de1dc57ba0b2f8b63